    "details": "X.Org reports:\n\n> Multiple issues have been found in the X client library\n> implementations published by X.Org for which we are releasing security\n> fixes for.\n>\n> - CVE-2026-88806: Out-of-bounds write vulnerability in libX11\\'s XKB\n>   (X Keyboard Extension) action parser\n> - CVE-2026-94283: Out-of-bounds read vulnerability in libX11\\'s XIM (X\n>   Input Method) attribute parser\n> - CVE-2026-94284: Out-of-bounds read vulnerability in libX11\\'s XIM\n>   trigger-key registration parser\n> - CVE-2026-94285: Out-of-bounds read in libX11\\'s byte-oriented\n>   codeset parser\n",
